\ admit-car.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 2
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch02/admit-car.8th
\
\ An executable "interface sketch": the decision is separated from the
\ actions it chooses between, and the top-level word reads as a flat
\ sentence describing the policy.

false var, garage-full?

: space-available?  garage-full? @ not ;
: let-in    "Welcome -- take a ticket.\n" . ;
: turn-away "Sorry, we're full.\n" . ;

: admit-car  \ --
  space-available? if let-in else turn-away then ;

admit-car               \ => Welcome -- take a ticket.

true garage-full? !
admit-car                \ => Sorry, we're full.

bye
